                                "style": "link"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-diagnostics",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Built-In Efficiency and Advanced Diagnostics",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "diagnostics"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-diagnostics-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "New trucks aren't just cleaner under the hood, they're smarter, too. Today's models come equipped with systems that monitor performance in real time. That means:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-diagnostics-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Early alerts for engine or brake issues"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Data-driven maintenance scheduling"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Easier diagnostics and quicker repairs"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-diagnostics-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we offer International® models with OnCommand® Connection, a cutting-edge fleet management system that helps you stay ahead of potential problems. The result? Less guesswork, fewer surprises, and more time on the road.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-fuel-economy",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Better Fuel Economy Means Bigger Savings",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "fuel-economy"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-fuel-economy-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "While the sticker price on a new truck may be higher, the fuel savings over time can be substantial. Most newer models are designed to meet stricter EPA standards and feature aerodynamic upgrades, lightweight components, and fuel-efficient engines.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-fuel-economy-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Fuel efficiency gains can save fleet owners thousands per truck each year, depending on routes and usage. When you're trying to make every load count, a few extra miles per gallon can make all the difference.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-emissions",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Emissions Compliance Made Easy",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "emissions"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-emissions-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Staying compliant with state and federal emissions regulations isn't optional, and older trucks may require costly upgrades to meet evolving standards. New trucks are already built to spec, which means one less thing on your plate. If you're hauling in or around urban areas with tighter environmental regulations, that compliance could even open the door to more business opportunities.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-emissions-2-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "co-emissions-2",
                      "type": "column",
                      "props": {
                        "span": 12
                      },
                      "styles": {
                        "base": {
                          "borderWidth": 1,
                          "borderStyle": "solid",
