                        }
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "co-emissions-2-cta",
                          "type": "buttons",
                          "props": {
                            "align": "left",
                            "items": [
                              {
                                "ctaId": "browse-new-trucks",
                                "label": "See Our Inventory →",
                                "style": "link"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-other-benefits",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Other Long-Term Benefits of Buying New",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "other-benefits"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "features-other-benefits-1",
                  "type": "list",
                  "props": {
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "columns": 2,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "label": "Higher Resale Value",
                        "desc": "New trucks naturally retain more value, especially when well-maintained. If your business grows or pivots and you decide to offload a unit, a newer truck will likely bring in a higher resale or trade-in value than a high-mileage used rig."
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "Driver Retention and Morale",
                        "desc": "Drivers notice when you invest in better equipment. A clean, quiet, comfortable ride goes a long way in helping you retain skilled drivers, especially in a competitive market. Advanced safety features, upgraded sleepers, or better suspension systems can pay off in stronger retention."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-right-move",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Is a New Truck the Right Move for Your Business?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "right-move"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-right-move-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we understand that cost is a major factor, but it's not the only one. When you break down semi truck maintenance costs and consider the time, money, and stress that older equipment can bring, the benefits of buying new speak for themselves.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-right-move-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "From longer uptime to fewer headaches, new trucks offer a clearer path to profitability. And with our expert team, in-house financing, and statewide service centers, we make the process straightforward and supportive from day one. Explore our inventory of new International® trucks and discover the right fit for your business.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "actions-right-move-3",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
                    "align": "left",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "ctaId": "browse-new-trucks",
